01:35:17.540 --> 01:35:22.850
GM: I went to a school that had 13 years of high school, because British schools do O-levels and A levels.

1210
01:35:23.120 --> 01:35:23.450
Grygum: Yeah.

1211
01:35:23.450 --> 01:35:30.300
GM: They did, they no longer do them. And so A-levels are essentially grades 12 and 13.

1212
01:35:31.810 --> 01:35:32.970
GM: And so my high school…

1213
01:35:32.970 --> 01:35:34.920
Grygum: immortalized in Harry Potter.

1214
01:35:34.920 --> 01:35:41.059
GM: Yes. And so, grade 12, However, they gave us a diploma at the end of grade 12,

1215
01:35:41.640 --> 01:35:46.299
GM: So that you could go to a U.S. college at grade 12 if you didn't want to spend the extra year to do the A-levels.

1216
01:35:46.720 --> 01:35:51.839
GM: And the Greek government had… the Greek government noticed that they had never actually sanctioned those degrees.

1217
01:35:53.510 --> 01:35:59.190
GM: And nobody had cared, but apparently in 2001, somebody cared.

1218
01:35:59.370 --> 01:36:04.329
GM: And, as a result of that caring,

1219
01:36:04.770 --> 01:36:18.110
GM: they decided that it wasn't… it didn't count as a full high school degree, but it counted as if you had graduated from grade 11 from high school. And that's really important in Greece, because there's a whole bunch of things that hinge on whether you have that degree or not.

1220
01:36:18.130 --> 01:36:27.879
GM: not, you know, like, in Greece, there's a lot more regulations and rules, etc, for everything. So yeah, so I told Mark that I… I, too, am a high school dropout.

1221
01:36:29.180 --> 01:36:29.630
Zalthir: Huh.

1222
01:36:30.430 --> 01:36:32.850
Thorin: You didn't do the 13th year, did you then go to a U.S. college?

1223
01:36:32.850 --> 01:36:38.540
GM: I did do the 13th year, but I don't have a high school degree, so I blessed myself.

1224
01:36:38.810 --> 01:36:39.880
Zalthir: Wait, wait…

1225
01:36:39.880 --> 01:36:43.500
Thorin: But what… do you get a degree after the 13th year? Wouldn't that be a high school degree?

1226
01:36:43.820 --> 01:36:44.730
Thorin: E-levels degree.

1227
01:36:45.000 --> 01:36:46.700
GM: That's an alibles thing.

1228
01:36:47.270 --> 01:36:49.889
Thorin: Okay, so it's just nomenclature here.

1229
01:36:49.890 --> 01:36:58.799
GM: Yes, yes, but, I mean, with Mark, this was such a point of bragging that it… you have to understand, I… I endured… I endured years of this.

1230
01:36:58.800 --> 01:36:59.290
Grygum: I, I…

1231
01:36:59.290 --> 01:37:03.819
Zalthir: It amuses me he never brought it up in front of me, because, you know… Yeah, but you were never.

1232
01:37:03.820 --> 01:37:06.270
GM: or try to give them direction, whereas I… where I was.

1233
01:37:06.270 --> 01:37:07.410
Zalthir: Yeah.

1234
01:37:07.840 --> 01:37:16.870
Grygum: I guess as someone who completed a PhD, it's hard to… it's hard to claim that I won't put up with any degree of bullshit.

1235
01:37:17.840 --> 01:37:28.909
Daz: Exactly. That PhD, isn't that, like… doesn't it actually stand for, I will put up with all kinds of bullshit? It does!

1236
01:37:28.910 --> 01:37:33.050
Grygum: Yeah, yeah, it's Latin, but that's what it means.

1237
01:37:35.340 --> 01:37:36.700
GM: Yeah, Zalthir, what happened to the gym?

1238
01:37:37.560 --> 01:37:40.650
Zalthir: It's over there! Now it's its own huge room.

1239
01:37:40.950 --> 01:37:42.640
GM: Did you buy a new house?

1240
01:37:42.640 --> 01:37:43.300
Zalthir: Yes.

1241
01:37:43.650 --> 01:37:44.600
GM: Oh, congratulations.

1242
01:37:44.600 --> 01:37:46.300
Zalthir: Wow, thanks.

1243
01:37:48.060 --> 01:37:48.730
GM: Where?

1244
01:37:49.360 --> 01:37:51.080
Zalthir: SF, Pack Hearts.

1245
01:37:51.300 --> 01:37:51.860
GM: Gotcha.

1246
01:37:52.420 --> 01:37:53.359
GM: Alright, folks.

1247
01:37:53.860 --> 01:37:54.440
Zalthir: All right.

1248
01:37:54.440 --> 01:37:56.779
GM: And with that, We won't… we will end.

1249
01:37:56.780 --> 01:37:57.700
Zalthir: Alright, have a good night.

1250
01:37:57.700 --> 01:37:58.130
Thorin: See y'all later.

1251
01:37:58.130 --> 01:37:59.700
Grygum: Good night, see you.

